course: dictionary
lesson: 2287
title: Crested
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A crest is a tuft of feathers, fur or skin that sticks up on top of an animal's head. When an animal has one, we call it crested. The word tells you the crest is there.
explain: The word also works for things, not just animals. A crested blazer or crested notepaper has a crest on it, which is a badge or decoration. Look at the words around the word to choose the right meaning: a badge on a blazer is not a tuft of feathers.
explain: «Picture a crested gecko licking its own eyeball: it has no moving eyelids, so its tongue is its windscreen wiper.» The sentence is about an animal, so crested means it has a crest on its head. The clue about no moving eyelids tells you why the gecko licks its eyes.
fact: A crest is a tuft of feathers, fur or skin on top of an animal's head.
fact: «Crested» means having a crest.
fact: Many animals are named for their crests, such as the crested newt, great crested grebe, crested tit and crested penguin.
fact: Crests can help animals show off or send signals to others.
fact: Things can be crested too: school blazers and jumpers are often crested with the school badge.
exercise: «Picture a crested gecko licking its own eyeball.» What does crested tell you about the gecko? | It has no legs at all | It can swim very fast | It is covered in glass | *It has a crest, a tuft of skin on top of its head
exercise: Which animal is named for its crest? | *Crested tit | Hedgehog | Badger | Rabbit
exercise: «The school blazer was crested with a gold badge.» What does crested mean here? | Very old and worn | Made of wool | *Decorated with a badge | Covered in feathers
test: «Crests help animals show off or signal.» What can a crest help an animal do? | *Show off or signal to others | Change colour in winter | Fly faster than other birds | Sleep in trees
test: A bird with a crest has what on its head? | A hard, shiny shell | A flat, bare top | A bright red hat | *A tuft of feathers
exam: Ella's notepaper is crested with a dragon badge. What does crested mean here? | Covered in feathers | Very quiet | *Decorated with a badge or crest | Made of paper and wood
